{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_07_end",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_07",
  "title": "一錘定音",
  "storyCode": "OF-7",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "39405f6b08891d8c5758eeaee64036933083d76ae5d8bc137294efba8fbd00ac",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你跟在我身邊十五年，什麼都沒有學會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只學到了一些上不了檯面的手段，真是個蠢材。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蠢材......呵呵，呵哈哈哈哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老東西，你該不會以為這就是我的最後一步棋了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
      "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
      "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "這......難道是火山爆發前引起的輕型地震？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來了，呵呵，終於來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跟這座城市一起化為塵埃吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即使現在你們想去控制廣播塔也晚了！市民只會陷入恐慌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "火山的活動日期近在眼前，你們以為有了那些簡單的樣本資料就能搞清楚什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快速的逃生管道都在我手裡！你們誰都逃不走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "假裝清高的傢伙們，你們誰都救不了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一切都會隨著城市的毀滅被消滅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "博士，怎麼辦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "趕緊動員大家疏散人群！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "至少先讓大家離開危險地區！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "博士，要不要通知羅德島全體......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，能聽到嗎！火山的分析研究完成了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "如果現在的話，還有機會能爭取到更多的時間！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，我們已經把火山活動的原因找到了，這次的火山活動很有可能是可以被阻止的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "現在大家冷靜下來聽我說，只要按照這個方法來，一定能把火山爆發的時間推遲！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "我們可以幫忙，如果真的是人力所及的話。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "......嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "錫蘭",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "不，這件事就交給我們吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "錫蘭",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "克洛寧已經蟄伏了這麼長的時間，他的殘黨必然佈及整座城市。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "錫蘭",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "現在正是最關鍵的時刻。黑，赫拉格爺爺，你們都有自己的事情要做。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "這些事情交給其他人去做就可以——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "錫蘭",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "但這是我們的任務。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "錫蘭......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "同意。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "天災信使，火山學家，源石學者，我們之中誰都不能容忍讓有所預兆的危機威脅到市民。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "更何況竟然有人利用自己的知識，蒙蔽他人，中飽私囊。作為天災信使，我可不能忍受自己在這種人面前還依然袖手旁觀！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "你竟然也會有這麼認真的一面，我明白了。那麼市長先生，疏散群眾的任務，請容我助你一臂之力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......嗯。黑，你也來吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "我——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "錫蘭說她可以做到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "......小姐，請務必小心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "討論好了嗎？我們的時間不多了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "錫蘭",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "嗯！我們趕緊出發吧！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們應該相信她，何況他們說的沒錯，我們有自己的事情要做。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛寧",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哼哈哈哈——他們根本就是去送死！就算能拖延一時半會又如何！？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛寧",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不僅大半座汐斯塔要陪著你的女兒送葬，而你根本就找不到她的屍首——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛寧",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呃——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "抱歉，順手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "無妨，何況他說的沒錯，不能讓市民們繼續身處險境了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "希望你們能助我一臂之力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
